'''The Day Dratini Grew Up''' (Japanese: '''ミニリュウがひとつおとなになつた日''' ''The Day {{tt|Miniryu|Dratini}} Grew Up'') is the first chapter of the [[How I Became a Pokémon Card]] manga created by [[Kagemaru Himeno]]. The card featured in this chapter is {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dratini|53}}.

{{incomplete|section}}

==Plot==
{{p|Dratini}} wants to be with humans, but when it does, it is captured by humans. The humans are hostile and suspicious with Dratini and lock it in a cage, 
but [[Bill]] convinces them to let him take care of Dratini. When Dratini's parents come to take it back, Bill gives it a seed as a parting gift. The Pokémon Card shows Dratini patiently waiting for the seed to grow. 

==Major events==
* {{p|Dratini}} wants to be with humans.

